  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-15T04:13:22.862582Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-17T01:57:18.565432Z",
  "totalBlocks": 39,
  "translatedBlocks": 38,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36431fba6a0b800f",
      "translationZh": "简而言之：对于许多 LLM 架构，transformers vLLM 后端如今已与定制的 vLLM 实现一样快，甚至更快。模型作者可以自动利用他们的 transformers 实现，获得超高速的 vLLM 推理，无需额外付出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e088c113a7c831a3",
      "translationZh": "transformers 库已成为机器学习领域的参考建模库。它通过一致的 API 支持 450+ 种架构，其设计的主要目标是让模型实现自成一体且易于理解。阅读 transformers 代码，贡献者就能轻松了解一种架构的工作原理，进而将其移植到 vLLM、SGLang、MLX、llama.cpp 等其他框架。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a94a1e7127545a5",
      "translationZh": "我们已全面拥抱在生态系统中的这一角色，并投入大量精力，让这件事变得更容易。去年，将 transformers 集成到 vLLM 中作为建模后端，是朝这一方向迈出的一大步。这使模型作者能够直接在 vLLM 中运行 transformers 模型（无论是 LLM 还是 VLM），而无需进行任何移植。Transformers 提供建模代码，vLLM 则提供经过极致优化的推理技术，例如连续批处理和定制注意力内核。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e19784cb3364a257",
      "translationZh": "现在，这项集成更进一步了 🚀！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9a15dc9c62db5943",
      "translationZh": "效果展示",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ee52ae750fac585",
      "translationZh": "我们选取了三个差异很大的 Qwen3 模型，让用于 vLLM 的 transformers 建模后端与 vLLM 手工编写的原生实现展开正面对比：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4a10a541b0d0b1d",
      "translationZh": "在单个 GPU 上运行的 4B 稠密模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f460445cb8300da6",
      "translationZh": "采用张量并行的 32B 稠密模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "438393a402b128c9",
      "translationZh": "在同一个 8×H100 节点上，采用数据并行 + 专家并行运行 235B 参数的 FP8 混合专家模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9266cf88c5bf9f0",
      "translationZh": "结果是：transformers 建模后端如今在所有这些模型上的吞吐量都达到或超过了原生实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c641688f2fec240d",
      "translationZh": "通过 transformers 建模后端运行任意* Hugging Face 模型，只需一个标志——--model-impl transformers。它可以与常用的并行选项组合使用，因此你的推理服务配置无需任何改动：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "521e3128a5656503",
      "translationZh": "*目前尚不支持使用线性注意力的模型，但很快就会支持！代码存放在 Hub 仓库中的自定义模型很可能无法运行，因为它们的代码并非按照兼容性要求编写。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d885cae46667ff66",
      "translationZh": "我们如何测量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e29513e6778af286",
      "translationZh": "每个模型都在三种条件下进行比较，除了代码路径之外，其他方面完全相同：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "60036abd12be6f48",
      "translationZh": "native — --model-impl vllm，使用 vLLM 手工编写的模型实现（需要达到的基准）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c1dcb2fe5f3243f5",
      "translationZh": "after — --model-impl transformers，包含该 PR 的改动",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c10e37424e157e6e",
      "translationZh": "改动前 — 使用 --model-impl transformers，未包含该 PR",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2928ab7f16c142db",
      "translationZh": "完整、可复现的运行脚本已发布为 gist：benchmark.sh",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6cc4a4341958d443",
      "translationZh": "那么，有什么新变化？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fbe59e5095afa55",
      "translationZh": "vLLM 的 transformers 建模后端过去主要关注注意力机制这一推理瓶颈。通过在运行时接入 vLLM 的注意力机制实现，我们能够让 transformers 模型在 vLLM 引擎中高效运行。但部署涉及许多维度，只有定制移植才能针对这些维度进行优化，从而榨取最大的推理性能。跨 GPU 并行化、编译、融合内核等诸多手段，都有助于充分利用硬件，实现超高速推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "448b3c1575bacd50",
      "translationZh": "过去，一个新模型需要为 transformers 集成一次，再为 vLLM 集成一次，并进行定制优化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c05407a448b7356",
      "translationZh": "当模型作者想要获得极致性能时，他们仍然需要编写定制的 vLLM 实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf09bb6007c4acff",
      "translationZh": "现在，一个新模型只要集成到 transformers，就可以立即在 vLLM 中使用，并达到原生 vLLM 实现的速度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76c3feb724877a89",
      "translationZh": "最新一版 vLLM 的 transformers 建模后端会在运行时动态应用专门针对推理的层融合，使兼容架构的运行速度能够媲美定制代码实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c3f15799af503a46",
      "translationZh": "它是如何工作的？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d333d1674ae22159",
      "translationZh": "vLLM 的 transformers 建模后端现在使用 torch.fx 对模型的计算图进行静态分析。这个过程会搜索可优化的已知模式。识别出模式后，它会使用 ast（抽象语法树）修改源代码，并就地重写其中的一些操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19f351237bf3c9d9",
      "translationZh": "我们能借此实现什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7cc1ebcab60cd9f6",
      "translationZh": "将多个操作融合，并以多对一的方式映射到经过（极致）优化的 vLLM 内核，例如混合专家（MoE）模型中用于专家并行化（EP）的内核。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c7dffb54dd1232f3",
      "translationZh": "其他主要的融合操作是 vLLM 的 MergedColumnParallelLinear 和 QKVParallelLinear。这些模块让我们能够推断 TP（张量并行）的并行方案。如果解码器模块列表易于识别，也可以推断 PP（流水线并行）方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e6dbb56de0725baf",
      "translationZh": "修改后的模型仍然完全可以通过（torch）编译，能够像专门的 vLLM 模型实现一样，经过 torch.compile 和 CUDA Graphs 处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2b1b58a95006a716",
      "translationZh": "与 vLLM 模型实现不同，Transformers 模型实现可以用于训练。因此，你可以将同一份模型代码用于训练、评估和强化学习 rollout。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c03b622049c3b8e5",
      "translationZh": "如上所示，这让兼容的模型能够达到原生 vLLM 的推理速度，而无需编写任何代码来针对推理优化模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b13a2443b51a8961",
      "translationZh": "我们正在撰写一篇详细的博客文章，深入探讨这些经过优化的推理方法，并详细说明我们如何调整模型以适配这些方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e89b30aa1dc30a6a",
      "translationZh": "资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "70108924f2bb902a",
      "translationZh": "Transformers 模型定义",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fa9d29c0be629e8d",
      "translationZh": "vLLM 中的 Transformers 建模后端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d48f16996f50f39f",
